@startuml

node "School Office PC/Laptop" {
[School Management System]
database "Local SQLite Database"
}

node "Backup Storage (USB Drive)" {
[Backup Files]
}

node "Printer" {
[Report Printing]
}

[School Management System] --> [Report Printing] : USB/Cable Connection
[School Management System] --> [Backup Files] : Daily Backup

note right of "School Office PC/Laptop"
Works fully offline.
Staff can manage students,
record fees and generate reports
without internet access.
end note

note bottom of "Backup Storage (USB Drive)"
Used to recover data after
power failure or hardware issues.
end note

@enduml
